WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.625
Eight tomatoes. Follow them into the farm record.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:10.417
Three go into the kitchen bowl.

00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:13.000
Write three under family food.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Two are sold. Follow them to the crate.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.458
Write two under sales.

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:24.958
These two are a gift.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.917
Write two under gifts.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:31.125
The split tomato goes to compost.

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:35.292
Write one under compost.

00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:40.792
Three, two, two and one. All eight are accounted for.
